    accTitle: Camera and gateway hardware
    accDescr: Gateway power, camera, display and motion sensor from Fridge.drawio. See the review notes for firmware differences.
    %% Pi-top [4] runs Raspberry Pi OS Bullseye (Legacy 64-bit) and Python 3.11 (uv).
    %% YOLOv8n handles food cropping and human detection. Mosquitto, Bleak and SQLite handle communications.
    %% PyQt5 UI uses Up, Down, O and X. Check-out defaults to FEFO.
    %% PIR wakes the display and webcam. They sleep after 10 minutes of inactivity.

    outlet["AC 220 V outlet"]
    brick["Pi-top USB-C power brick"]
    gateway["C0 · Pi-top [4] / Raspberry Pi 4<br/>Local vision, Mosquitto and offline queue"]
    webcam["Logitech 720p webcam"]
    lcd["5-inch LCD<br/>Up, Down, O and X buttons"]
    pir["Digital PIR motion sensor<br/>Wakes the screen and webcam"]

    outlet --> brick
    brick -->|"USB-C · 5 V"| gateway
    webcam -->|"USB-A · /dev/video0"| gateway
    gateway -->|"Micro-HDMI + USB power"| lcd
    pir -->|"GPIO 22 · 5 V"| gateway
